        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;&#39; -------------------- 7. SYSTEM SEQUENCE (SSD): UC-02 --------------------\n@startuml Sada_Sequence_UC02\ntitle UC-02 — Submit Sensitive Support Request (System Sequence Diagram)\nautonumber\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam sequence {\n  ActorBorderColor #334155\n  ParticipantBorderColor #334155\n  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC\n  LifeLineBorderColor #64748B\n  ArrowColor #334155\n}\n\nactor Customer\nparticipant \&quot;Sada Platform\&quot; as System\nparticipant \&quot;Sada AI Service\&quot; as AI\n\nCustomer -&gt; System: submitSensitiveSupportRequest(requestType, details, voiceRecording)\nSystem -&gt; System: authenticateCustomer(),\\nvalidateAudioFile(type, size, header)\n\nalt Authentication or audio validation fails\n  System --&gt; Customer: returnValidationError(reason)\nelse Valid request and audio\n  System -&gt; System: createSupportTicket(),\\nstoreEncryptedReviewCopy()\n  System -&gt; AI: analyzeAudioRecording(ticketId, audioPayload)\n\n  alt Sada AI responds with assessment\n    AI --&gt; System: returnAssessment(spoofScore, qualityStatus, modelVersion)\n    System -&gt; System: evaluateRiskRules(assessment)\n  else Sada AI unavailable or times out\n    System -&gt; System: markAssessmentUnavailable(),\\napplyNonAIRiskRules()\n  end\n\n  alt Risk policy requires human review\n    System -&gt; System: suspendOperation(),\\nopenReviewCase(status=\&quot;PENDING_REVIEW\&quot;)\n  else Standard support handling\n    System -&gt; System: routeToStandardSupport(status=\&quot;SUBMITTED\&quot;)\n  end\n\n  System -&gt; System: recordAuditEvent()\n  System --&gt; Customer: returnTicketReference(ticketId, status)\nend\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="TgTziPrXvUSxa3XX-cSn-1">
